  "notes": [
    "Ciel/open_pdks f6eeac7dad085ffcc829ccfd721f7b4ce39edcf7; purposes follow the KLayout LEF/DEF map (NET/SPNET/VIA/PIN/NAME .../LABEL, DIEAREA) and agree with the Magic gdsii cifoutput calma numbers.",
